<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Not by bread alone,</l><l>But by the Word of God,</l><l>Not by bread alone</l><l>But by the Word of God!</l><l>NO! man cannot live by</l><l>Earthly bread alone;</l><l>YES! we need the words of the</l><l>B-I-B-L-E!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
